#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/chapter.rst:2
msgid "Installation and configuration of MapServer"
msgstr "MapServer的安装和配置"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/chapter.rst:4
msgid ""
"One of the ways to realize WebGIS is to use Common Gateway Interface "
"(CGI) technology. On the server side, through the CGI application program"
" to connect WebServer and GIS spatial database, the client only needs to "
"use the browser to query and analyze the spatial data. The famous open "
"source GIS server-side tool MapServer uses CGI technology."
msgstr "使用公共网关接口(CGI)技术是实现WebGIS的一种方式。在服务器端，通过CGI应用程序连接WebServer和地理信息系统空间数据库，客户端只需使用浏览器即可对空间数据进行查询和分析。著名的开源GIS服务器端工具MapServer使用CGI技术。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/chapter.rst:10
msgid ""
"Compared with the many WebGIS solutions provided by commercial "
"enterprises, MapServer is an open source project. This means that you can"
" use MapServer for free and have the right to modify, copy, and "
"redistribute it on your own. It should be pointed out that MapServer, as "
"an open source project, is in continuous development, but in recent "
"years, the function has been relatively perfect and the update is "
"relatively small."
msgstr "与商业企业提供的众多WebGIS解决方案相比，MapServer是一个开源项目。这意味着您可以免费使用MapServer，并有权自行修改、复制和重新分发它。需要指出的是，MapServer作为一个开源项目，正在不断发展中，但近年来，功能已经比较完善，更新比较少。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/chapter.rst:18
msgid ""
"At present, the mainstream Linux operating systems, such as Debian, "
"Ubuntu, Centos and so on, have MapServer versions above 7.0. The content "
"of this book is based on MapServer version 7. 0 and later."
msgstr "目前主流的Linux操作系统，如Debian、Ubuntu、CentOS等，MapServer版本都在7.0以上。本书的内容基于MapServer7.0版和更高版本。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/chapter.rst:22
msgid ""
"This chapter explains the installation and configuration of MapServer to "
"understand basic usage and related tools, how to generate map images, and"
" how to access them through Web. After you set up the MapServer, you need"
" to tell it the location of all resources and make sure that all "
"permissions are set correctly. Because more useful MapServer applications"
" have more lines of code and contain many HTML templates, keep the "
"application simple to make it easier to debug when errors occur."
msgstr "本章介绍了MapServer的安装和配置，以了解地图服务器的基本用法和相关工具，如何生成地图图像，以及如何通过Web访问地图图像。在设置MapServer之后，您需要告诉它所有资源的位置，并确保正确设置了所有权限。因为更有用的MapServer应用程序有更多的代码行并包含许多HTML模板，所以应使应用程序保持简单，以便在发生错误时更容易进行调试。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:4
msgid "Introduction to MapServer"
msgstr "MapServer简介"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:6
msgid ""
"MapServer is a real-time map publishing system based on the fat "
"server/thin client mode. When the client sends a data request, the server"
" processes the spatial data in real time and sends the generated data to "
"the client. The core part of MapServer is the map operation module "
"written in C language, and the implementation of many functions of "
"MapServer itself depends on some open source or free libraries."
msgstr "MapServer是一个基于胖服务器/瘦客户端模式的实时地图发布系统。当客户端发送数据请求时，服务器实时处理空间数据，并将生成的数据发送给客户端。MapServer的核心部分是用C语言编写的地图操作模块，MapServer本身的许多功能的实现都依赖于一些开源或自由库。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:13
msgid ""
"The core part of MapServer is the map manipulation module written in C "
"language, and many of its functions rely on some open source or free "
"libraries. Using the support of GEOS and OGR/GDAL for a variety of vector"
" and raster data, the projection transformation is carried out in real "
"time through the Proj.4 shared library. MapServer follows OGC series "
"specifications and can integrate PostGIS and open source database "
"PostgreSQL, and store and SQL query the geospatial data. Based on a "
"series of client-side JavaScript APIs such as ka-map, MapLab, Cartoweb "
"and Chameleon to support the transmission and expression of geospatial "
"data, and comply with a series of WMS, WFS, WCS, WMC, SLD, GML and Filter"
" Encoding formulated by OGC specification."
msgstr ""
"MapServer的核心部分是用C语言编写的地图操纵模块，它的许多功能都依赖于一些开放源码或自由库。利用GEOS和OGR/GDAL对各种矢量和栅格数据的支持，通过Proj.4共享库实时进行投影变换。MapServer遵循OGC系列规范，可以集成PostGIS和开源数据库PostgreSQL，并对地理空间数据进行存储和SQL查询"
"。基于ka-map、MapLab、Caroweb、Chameleon等一系列客户端JAVASCRIPT "
"API，支持地理空间数据的传输和表达，并遵循OGC规范制定的一系列WMS、WFS、WCS、WMC、SLD、GML和Filter编码。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:26
msgid "Development history of MapServer"
msgstr "MapServer的发展历史"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:28
msgid ""
"MapServer is an open source geospatial data rendering engine written in C"
" language. It originated from the University of Minnesota (UMN), NASA and"
" the Minnesota Department of Natural Resources (MNDNR) in the mid-1990s. "
"A collaborative project - ForNet, and later the TerrSIP project. "
"Government support played a big role in the early development of "
"MapServer."
msgstr ""
"MapServer是一个用C语言编写的开源地理空间数据渲染引擎。它起源于20世纪90年代中期的明尼苏达大学(UMN)、美国国家航空航天局(NASA)和明尼苏达州自然资源部(MNDNR)。一个协作项目"
"--Fornet，以及后来的TerrSIP项目。政府的支持在MapServer的早期开发中发挥了重要作用。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:35
msgid ""
"This is an open source software released under the MIT-style License for "
"publishing spatial data and interactive map applications on the Web, "
"supporting all major operating systems, including Windows, Linux, Mac OS "
"X, etc. Its positioning is not to implement a full-featured GIS, but to "
"provide most of the core GIS functions for Web applications."
msgstr ""
"这是一款在麻省理工学院风格的许可下发布的开源软件，用于在Web上发布空间数据和交互地图应用程序，支持所有主要操作系统，包括Windows、Linux、Mac"
" OS X等。它的定位不是实现一个功能齐全的GIS，而是为Web应用程序提供大部分核心的GIS功能。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:41
msgid ""
"In 1994, Steve Lime, the father of MapServer, and his MapServer were "
"familiar to more people. MapServer is not isolated in its development and"
" growth, but has been supported by many open source communities and open "
"source enthusiasts. In November 2005, the MapServer Foundation was "
"established with the aim of “promoting a professional open source network"
" mapping development environment and community. Even though it initially "
"focused on network mapping projects, it hopes to provide funding to other"
" open source geographic information projects”, not only promotes the "
"professional development of MapServer, but also promotes the development "
"of the entire open source network mapping technology."
msgstr ""
"1994年，MapServer的父亲Steve "
"Lime和他的MapServer为更多的人所熟悉。MapServer在其发展和增长中并不是孤立的，而是得到了许多开源社区和开源爱好者的支持。2005年11月，MapServer基金会成立，其宗旨是“促进一个专业的开源网络地图开发环境和社区。即使它最初只专注于网络地图项目，但它希望能为其他开源地理信息项目提供资金“，不仅促进MapServer的专业发展，也促进整个开源网络地图技术的发展。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:52
msgid ""
"With the further development of open source geographic information system"
" software and the further optimization of open source network mapping "
"environment, in February 2006, the MapServer Foundation was officially "
"renamed the Open Source Geospatial Foundation (OSGeo), and Autodesk added"
" MapGuide as an open source code to the foundation. It will further "
"promote the development of MapServer."
msgstr "随着开源地理信息系统软件的进一步开发和开源网络地图环境的进一步优化，2006年2月，MapServer基金会正式更名为开源地理空间基金会(OSGeo)，Autodesk将MapGuide作为开源代码加入基金会。这将进一步推动MapServer的发展。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:60
#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:272
msgid "Characteristics of MapServer"
msgstr "MapServer的特点"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:62
msgid ""
"MapServer is a popular open source project for displaying dynamic spatial"
" maps on the Internet. It has the following characteristics:"
msgstr "MapServer是一个流行的开源项目，用于在Internet上显示动态空间地图。它具有以下特点："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:65
msgid ""
"Support for displaying and querying hundreds of grid, vector and database"
" formats. Supported vector formats: ESRI shapefiles, PostGIS, ArcSDE of "
"ESRI, etc. (implemented by OGR library). Supported grid formats: "
"TIFF/GeoTIFF, EPPL7, etc. (implemented through the GDAL library). For "
"shapefile files, you can build a quad tree spatial index."
msgstr ""
"支持显示和查询数百种网格、矢量和数据库格式。支持的矢量格式：Esri "
"shapefile、PostGIS、ESRI的ArcSDE等(由OGR库实现)。支持的网格格式：TIFF/GeoTIFF、EPPL7等(通过GDAL库实现)。对于shapefile文件，可以构建四叉树空间索引。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:71
msgid "Ability to run on many different systems (Windows, Linux, Mac OS X, etc.)"
msgstr "能够在多种不同的系统(Windows、Linux、Mac OS X等)上运行"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:73
msgid ""
"Available in two ways: CGI (for CGI, Ajax, Flex developers) and MapScript"
" (For Php, Java, C # developers), native CGI is the most efficient"
msgstr "有两种方式可用：CGI(适用于CGI、AJAX、Flex开发人员)和MapScript(适用于PHP、Java、C#开发人员)，原生CGI是最高效的"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:76
msgid ""
"Support for popular scripting languages and development environments "
"(PHP, Python, Perl, Ruby, Java, .NET)"
msgstr "支持流行的脚本语言和开发环境(PHP、Python、Perl、Ruby、Java、.NET)"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:78
msgid "On-the-fly projection"
msgstr "即时投影"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:79
msgid "High quality rendering model"
msgstr "高质量渲染模型"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:80
msgid "The output of custom template is fully supported."
msgstr "完全支持自定义模板输出。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:81
msgid "Many off-the-shelf open source application environments"
msgstr "许多现成的开源应用程序环境"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:82
msgid ""
"MapFile is the core of MapServer. It organizes various map elements into "
"a hierarchical object system, and define the data source, the data format"
" used, user interaction and support for the OGC protocol."
msgstr " Mapfile 是地图服务器的核心。它将各种地图元素组织成一个分层的对象系统，并定义了数据源、使用的数据格式、用户交互以及对OGC协议的支持。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:85
msgid ""
"Support the font standard TrueType jointly developed by Microsoft and "
"Apple."
msgstr "支持微软和苹果联合开发的字体标准TrueType。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:87
msgid "Block (tiled) vector and raster data are supported."
msgstr "支持块(平铺)矢量和栅格数据。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:88
msgid ""
"Automatic control of map elements (such as scale, legend, reference, "
"etc.)."
msgstr "自动控制地图元素(如比例、图例、参考等)。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:90
msgid "The image scale is adjusted automatically."
msgstr "图像比例是自动调整的。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:91
msgid "Generate thematic maps using logical or regular expressions."
msgstr "使用逻辑或正则表达式生成专题地图。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:92
msgid "Feature annotations (including dimension conflict resolution)."
msgstr "特征标注(包括尺寸冲突解决)。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:93
msgid "MapServer can be configured dynamically through URLs."
msgstr "可以通过URL动态配置MapServer。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:94
msgid "Dynamic projection transformation is supported."
msgstr "支持动态投影变换。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:95
msgid ""
"Support for several Open Geospatial Consortium network specifications: "
"WMS (client/server), non-transactional WFS (client/server), WCS (server "
"only), WMC, SLD,GML and Filter Encoding."
msgstr "支持多种开放地理空间联盟网络规范：WMS(客户端/服务器)、非事务性WFS(客户端/服务器)、WCS(仅服务器)、WMC、SLD、GML和过滤器编码。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:99
msgid ""
"In its most basic form, MapServer is an inactive CGI program on a Web "
"server. When a request is sent to MapServer, it uses the information and "
"Mapfile passed in the requested URL. Creates an image of the requested "
"map, the request can return the legend, ruler, reference map and variable"
" values passed by CGI."
msgstr "在其最基本的形式中，MapServer是Web服务器上的非活动CGI程序。当请求被发送到MapServer时，它使用在请求的URL中传递的信息和Mapfile。创建所请求地图的图像，请求可以返回由CGI传递的图例、标尺、参考地图和变量值。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:105
msgid ""
"Compared with the many WebGIS solutions provided by commercial "
"enterprises, MapServer is an open source project. This means that you can"
" use MapServer for free and have the right to modify, copy and "
"redistribute it yourself, MapServer has many advantages as well:"
msgstr "与商业企业提供的众多WebGIS解决方案相比，MapServer是一个开源项目。这意味着您可以免费使用MapServer，并有权自行修改、复制和重新分发，MapServer也有许多优势："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:110
msgid ""
"MapServer is an open source real-time map publishing system based on fat "
"server / thin client mode. When the client sends data requests, the "
"server processes the spatial data in real time and sends the generated "
"data to the client. The core part of MapServer is the map operation "
"module written in C language, and many of its functions depend on some "
"open source or free libraries."
msgstr "MapServer是一个开源的基于胖服务器/瘦客户端模式的实时地图发布系统。当客户端发送数据请求时，服务器实时处理空间数据，并将生成的数据发送给客户端。MapServer的核心部分是用C语言编写的地图操作模块，它的许多功能都依赖于一些开源或自由库。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:117
msgid ""
"Using GEOS, OGR/GDAL to support a variety of vector and raster data, "
"real-time projection transformation through the Proj.4 shared library. At"
" the same time, it also integrates PostGIS and the open source database "
"PostgreSQL to store and query geospatial data, and supports the "
"transmission and expression of geospatial data based on a series of "
"client-side JavaScript APIs such as ka-map, MapLab, Cartoweb, and "
"Chameleon. A series of specifications such as WMS, WFS, WCS, WMC, SLD, "
"GML and Filter Encoding formulated by OGC."
msgstr ""
"使用GEOS、OGR/GDAL来支持各种矢量和栅格数据，通过Proj.4共享库进行实时投影变换。同时，它还集成了PostGIS和开源数据库PostgreSQL来存储和查询地理空间数据"
"，并基于ka-map、MapLab、Caroweb、Chameleon等一系列客户端Java "
"API支持地理空间数据的传输和表达。OGC制定的WMS、WFS、WCS、WMC、SLD、GML和Filter Ending等一系列规范。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:126
msgid ""
"MapServer creates a map image based on spatial information stored in a "
"digital format. It can handle vector and raster data. MapServer can "
"render more than 20 different vector data formats, including "
"shapefile,PostGIS and ArcSDE geometric features OPeNDAP,Arc/Info coverage"
" and Census TIGER files."
msgstr ""
"MapServer基于以数字格式存储的空间信息创建地图图像。它可以处理矢量和栅格数据。MapServer可以渲染20多种不同的矢量数据格式，包括Shapefile、PostGIS和ArcSDE几何要素OPeNDAP、Arc/Info"
" Coverage和人口普查TIGER文件。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:132
msgid ""
"Not all information displayed on the map must be in vector format. For "
"example, aerial or satellite photos of an area can be displayed behind "
"the rendered vector data to understand more clearly how these vector "
"elements relate to the characteristics of the real world. MapServer reads"
" two grid formats natively: GeoTIFF and EPPL7. However, you can read more"
" than 20 formats (including Windows bitmaps, GIF, and JPEG) through the "
"GDAL package, although MapServer understands and can render these grid "
"types, it cannot mark images with spatial information."
msgstr "并不是地图上显示的所有信息都必须是矢量格式。例如，一个地区的航空或卫星照片可以显示在渲染的矢量数据后面，以更清楚地了解这些矢量元素如何与现实世界的特征相关。MapServer本机读取两种网格格式：GeoTIFF和EPPL7。然而，您可以通过GDAL包读取20多种格式(包括Windows位图、GIF和JPEG)，尽管MapServer理解并可以渲染这些网格类型，但它不能使用空间信息标记图像。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:144
msgid "Components of MapServer"
msgstr "MapServer的组件"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:146
msgid ""
"One of the realization methods of WebGIS is to use Common Gateway "
"Interface (CGI) technology. On the server side, the WebServer and the GIS"
" spatial database are connected through the CGI application program, and "
"the client side can query and analyze the spatial data only by using the "
"browser [2]. The University of Minnesota in the United States provides a "
"WebGIS solution: MapServer, which uses CGI technology."
msgstr ""
"WebGIS的实现方法之一是使用公共网关接口(CGI)技术。在服务器端，WebServer与地理信息系统空间数据库通过CGI应用程序连接，客户端只需使用浏览器即可对空间数据进行查询和分析"
" [2] 。美国明尼苏达大学提供了一种WebGIS解决方案：MapServer，它使用CGI技术。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:153
msgid ""
"MapServer is an open source WebGIS project developed in C language. It is"
" a real-time map publishing system based on fat server / thin client "
"mode. When the client sends data requests, the server processes the "
"spatial data in real time and sends the generated data to the client."
msgstr "MapServer是一个用C语言开发的开源WebGIS项目。它是一个基于胖服务器/瘦客户端模式的实时地图发布系统。当客户端发送数据请求时，服务器实时处理空间数据，并将生成的数据发送给客户端。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:158
msgid "MapServer supports a three-tier architecture:"
msgstr "MapServer支持三层架构："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:160
msgid "Application layer: client browser"
msgstr "应用层：客户端浏览器"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:161
msgid ""
"Middle tier: MapServer CGI module / scripting language + MapScript, Web "
"server"
msgstr "中间层：MapServer CGI模块/脚本语言+MapScrip、Web服务器"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:163
msgid "Storage tier: GIS spatial database"
msgstr "存储层：地理信息系统空间数据库"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:165
msgid ""
"A simple MapServer consists of the following parts, as shown in the "
"figure:"
msgstr "一个简单的MapServer由如下几部分组成，如图所示："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:171
msgid "Schematic of MapServer principle"
msgstr "MapServer原理示意图"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:173
msgid "MapFile"
msgstr "MapFile"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:175
msgid ""
"Structured text configuration files for MapServer applications. It "
"defines the field of the map and is used to tell MapServer where the data"
" is and where to output the image. It also defines the map layer. "
"Including their data source, projection and notation. It must have a .map"
" extension, otherwise MapServer will not recognize it. MapFile files "
"organize various map elements into a system of objects with hierarchical "
"relationships. Data sources, data formats used, user interaction and "
"support for the OGC protocol are also defined in MapFile. Objects "
"included in MapFile and their hierarchical relationships:"
msgstr ""
"MapServer应用程序的结构化文本配置文件。它定义地图的字段，并用于告诉MapServer数据在哪里以及输出图像的位置。它还定义了地图层。包括它们的数据来源、投影和记法。它必须具有.map扩展名，否则MapServer将无法识别它。"
" Mapfile 将各种地图元素组织成具有层次关系的对象系统。数据来源、使用的数据格式、用户交互以及对OGC协议的支持也在MapFile中定义。 "
"Mapfile 中包含的对象及其层次关系："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:186
msgid "Geographic Data"
msgstr "地理数据"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:188
msgid ""
"MapServer can take advantage of many types of geographic information data"
" sources. The default is the ESRI data format, and other formats of data "
"are also supported."
msgstr "MapServer可以利用多种类型的地理信息数据源。默认为ESRI数据格式，也支持其他数据格式。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:192
msgid "HTMLPages"
msgstr "HTMLPages"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:194
msgid ""
"It is the interface between the user and MapServer, usually located at "
"the web root. In its simplest form, MapServer can be called to place a "
"static map image on an HTML page. To make the map interactive, the image "
"is placed on an HTML form on the page."
msgstr "它是用户和MapServer之间的接口，通常位于Web根目录。在其最简单的形式中，可以调用MapServer将静态地图图像放置在一个HTML页面上。要使地图具有互动性，需要将图像放置在页面上的一个HTML表单上。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:199
msgid "MapServer CGI"
msgstr "地图服务器CGI"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:201
msgid ""
"Binary executables. It can receive requests to return images, data, etc.,"
" located in the cgi-bin or scripts directory of the web server. The user "
"of the WEB server must have execute permissions on these directories. For"
" security reasons, they cannot be in the root directory of the web. By "
"default, this program is called mapserv."
msgstr ""
"二进制可执行文件。它可以接收返回位于Web服务器的cgi-"
"bin或脚本目录中的图像、数据等的请求。Web服务器的用户必须对这些目录具有执行权限。出于安全原因，它们不能位于Web的根目录中。默认情况下，此程序名为mapserv。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:207
msgid "WEB/HTTP Server"
msgstr "Web/HTTP服务器"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:209
msgid ""
"The HTML page is provided when the user’s browser is hit. You need a "
"working Web (HTTP) server. For example, Apache or Microsoft’s IIS, they "
"are on the same machine where you installed MapServer."
msgstr "当用户的浏览器被点击时，就会提供该HTML页面。您需要一个工作正常的Web(HTTP)服务器。例如，阿帕奇或微软的IIS，它们位于安装MapServer的同一台计算机上。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:214
msgid "Two modes of MapServer"
msgstr "MapServer的两种模式"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:216
msgid ""
"MapServer can be regarded as the general name of two independent modules:"
" MapServer CGI module and MapScript module. On the server side, any "
"module can be used to write WebGIS programs. However, they use the same "
"configuration file MapFile."
msgstr ""
"MapServer可以看作是两个独立模块的总称：MapServer "
"CGI模块和MapScrip模块。在服务器端，任何模块都可以用来编写WebGIS程序。但是，它们使用相同的配置文件MapFile。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:221
msgid ""
"MapServer can run in two different modes: CGI and MapScript. In CGI mode,"
" MapServer runs as a CGI script in the Web server environment. This is "
"easy to set up and produce fast, direct applications. In MapScript mode, "
"you can access MapServer API from Perl,Python or PHP. The MapScript "
"interface allows flexible, feature-rich applications that can still take "
"advantage of MapServer’s template tools."
msgstr ""
"MapServer可以在两种不同的模式下运行：CGI和MapScrip。在CGI模式下，MapServer在Web服务器环境中作为CGI脚本运行。这很容易设置和生成快速、直接的应用程序。在MapScrip模式下，您可以从Perl、Python或PHP访问MapServer"
" API。MapScript接口允许灵活、功能丰富的应用程序仍然可以利用MapServer的模板工具。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:229
msgid "Comparison between MapServer and GeoServer"
msgstr "MapServer与Geoserver的比较"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:231
msgid ""
"MapServer and GeoServer are both widely used open source WebGIS tools. "
"Both publish maps through the Internet and are often compared. MAPSERVER "
"is also OGC-compliant WMS and non-transactional WFS, based on CGI and "
"written in C++; GEOSERVER is written in Java (you need to install Java "
"SDK (not JRE) to run it), based on servlet and using the struts "
"framework."
msgstr ""
"MapServer和Geoserver都是广泛使用的开源WebGIS工具。两者都通过互联网发布地图，并经常被比较。MAPSERVER也是符合OGC的WMS和非事务性WFS，基于CGI并用C++编写；Geoserver是用Java编写的(您需要安装Java"
" SDK(而不是JRE)才能运行它)，基于Servlet并使用Struts框架。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:238
msgid ""
"Functionally: MapServer is weaker than GeoServer, QGIS and stronger than "
"UDIG."
msgstr "功能上：MapServer弱于Geoserver、QGIS，强于UDIG。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:240
msgid ""
"Efficiency: Mapserver’s support for WMS (Web Map service) is more "
"efficient, while Geoserver is better at attribute queries combined with "
"WFS (Web Feature service) specifications."
msgstr ""
"效率：MapServer对WMS(Web地图服务)的支持更高效，而Geoserver更擅长结合WFS(Web Feature "
"Service)规范进行属性查询。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:244
msgid ""
"In addition to functional comparison, special attention should be paid to"
" the technical selection during development. MapServer focuses on map "
"service functions and can be used as project components (or even core "
"components), but other functions need to be implemented by developers "
"most of the time; GeoServer is a relatively complete suite, which can "
"basically be used as a product after deployment and installation."
msgstr "除了功能比较外，在开发过程中还应特别注意技术选择。MapServer专注于地图服务功能，可以作为项目组件(甚至核心组件)，但其他功能大部分时间需要开发者来实现；Geoserver是一个相对完整的套装，部署安装后基本可以作为产品使用。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:251
msgid ""
"MapServer is not a full-featured GIS, it does not provide integrated DBMS"
" (Database Management System) tools, it has limited analytical "
"capabilities, and there are no georeferencing tools."
msgstr "MapServer不是一个功能齐全的地理信息系统，它没有提供集成的DBMS(数据库管理系统)工具，它的分析能力有限，并且没有地理配准工具。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:255
msgid ""
"Which is better? It’s hard to tell, depending on how you want to publish "
"your data and what language you’re better at using. Both are excellent "
"and have excellent documentation and user base. GEOSERVER enables you to "
"edit spatial data online and generate thematic maps. Maps are published "
"in XML files. MAPSERVER is good at generating thematic maps and is more "
"mature than ever. Maps are published through text configuration files."
msgstr "哪种更好些呢？很难说，这取决于你想要如何发布你的数据，以及你更擅长使用什么语言。这两个网站都很出色，都有出色的文档和用户基础。Geoserver使您能够在线编辑空间数据和生成专题地图。地图以XML文件形式发布。MAPSERVER擅长生成专题地图，比以往任何时候都更加成熟。地图通过文本配置文件发布。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:262
msgid ""
"Which one is more appropriate? I advocate using MapServer if you just "
"publish the map and don’t allow modification, it’s easier to maintain. "
"GeoServer was chosen because of wanting better features such as online "
"editing and database support like PostgreSQL or Oracle spatial database, "
"another advantage of GeoServer is that there is a free client software "
"UDIG."
msgstr "哪一个更合适？我主张使用MapServer，如果你只发布地图，不允许修改，它更容易维护。选择Geoserver是因为想要更好的功能，如在线编辑和数据库支持，如PostgreSQL或Oracle空间数据库，Geoserver的另一个优势是有一个免费的客户端软件UDIG。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:274
msgid ""
"Provides two ways of working, the CGI way (for CGI, AJAX, FLEX "
"developers) and the MapScript way (for Php, Java, C#, Python developers)."
" The native CGI method is the most efficient, and with TileCache, large-"
"scale map tile data can be quickly generated. Compared with commercial or"
" open source platforms based on .Net and J2EE, MapServer is more suitable"
" for high-load large-scale Internet map applications. MapServer is a map "
"service software written based on C, which is faster than GeoServer "
"written in JAVA. Moreover, the history of MapServer is longer than that "
"of GeoServer, and even the performance of MapServer is comparable to that"
" of commercial ArcIMS."
msgstr "提供了两种工作方式，CGI方式(适用于CGI、AJAX、Flex开发人员)和MapScrip方式(适用于PHP、Java、C#、Python开发人员)。原生CGI方法是最高效的，使用TileCache可以快速生成大比例的地图切片数据。与基于.Net和J2EE的商业或开源平台相比，MapServer更适合于高负载的大规模互联网地图应用。MapServer是一个基于C语言编写的地图服务软件，速度比用Java编写的Geoserver要快。此外，MapServer的历史比Geoserver要长，甚至在性能上也可以与商业ArcIMS相媲美。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:286
msgid "Characteristics of GeoServer"
msgstr "地球服务器的特点"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:288
msgid ""
"GeoServer（http://geoserver.org/ ）is a J2EE compliant and implements the "
"WCS, WMS and WFS specifications , supports TransactionWFS (WFS-T), and "
"its technical core is the integration of the well-known Java-developed "
"GIS tools GeoTools."
msgstr ""
"Geoserver(http://geoserver.org/)是一个符合J2EE规范的，实现了WCS、WMS和WFS规范，支持Transaction"
" WFS(WFS-T)，其技术核心是集成了著名的JAVA开发的地理信息系统工具GeoTools。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:293
msgid ""
"For spatial information storage, it supports ESRI Shapefile and spatial "
"databases such as PostGIS, Oracle, and ArcSDE, and the output GML files "
"meet the requirements of GML2.1."
msgstr ""
"对于空间信息存储，它支持ESRI "
"shapefile和空间数据库，如PostGIS、Oracle和ArcSDE，输出的GML文件符合GML2.1的要求。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:297
msgid ""
"Because it is pure Java, it is more suitable for complex environmental "
"requirements, and because of its open source, development organizations "
"can flexibly implement specific target requirements based on GeoServer, "
"which are lacking in commercial GIS components."
msgstr "由于它是纯Java，更适合于复杂的环境需求，而且由于它的开源，开发组织可以基于Geoserver灵活地实现特定的目标需求，这是商业GIS组件所缺乏的。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:302
msgid ""
"As a pure Java implementation, GeoServer is deployed in application "
"servers, such as Tomcat; its WMS and WFS components respond to requests "
"from browsers or uDig to access configured spatial databases, such as "
"PostGIS, OracleSpatial, etc., and generate Maps and GML documents are "
"transferred to the client."
msgstr "作为一种纯Java实现，Geoserver部署在Tomcat等应用服务器上；其WMS和WFS组件响应浏览器或uDig的请求来访问已配置的空间数据库，如PostGIS、OracleSpace等，并生成地图和GML文档传输到客户端。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:308
msgid "GeoServer has the following advantages:"
msgstr "Geoserver具有以下优势："

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:310
msgid ""
"Written in Java language, standard J2EE framework, based on servlet and "
"STRUTS framework, supporting efficient Spring framework development;"
msgstr "用Java语言编写，标准的J2EE框架，基于Servlet和Struts框架，支持高效的Spring框架开发；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:313
msgid "Compatible with WMS and WFS features, support WFS-T specification;"
msgstr "兼容WMS和WFS功能，支持WFS-T规范；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:314
msgid "Efficient database supports PostGIS, ShapeFile, ArcSDE,Oracle, MySQL, etc."
msgstr "高效的数据库支持PostGIS、Shapefile、ArcSDE、Oracle、MySQL等。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:316
msgid "Support hundreds of projections;"
msgstr "支持数百个投影；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec01_mapserver/section.rst:317
msgid "Ability to output network maps to formats such as jpeg, gif, png;"
msgstr "能够将网络地图输出为jpeg、gif、png等格式；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:5
msgid "Install and configure MapServer"
msgstr "安装和配置MapServer"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:7
msgid ""
"Setting up the initial runtime environment when starting a job can be "
"tedious, especially when following the step-by-step steps, but the basic "
"“Hello World” still doesn’t appear, and it can be maddening. Building a "
"running environment requires comprehensive technology, some experience, "
"and a bit of luck. Don’t underestimate the ability to configure the "
"runtime environment. Many programmers cannot build a development "
"environment by themselves, let alone a real production environment."
msgstr ""
"在启动作业时设置初始运行时环境可能会很乏味，特别是在遵循循序渐进的步骤时，但基本的“Hello "
"World”仍然没有出现，而且可能会令人抓狂。营造跑步环境需要全面的技术、一定的经验和一点运气。不要低估配置运行时环境的能力。许多程序员不能自己构建开发环境，更不用说真正的生产环境了。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:16
msgid "Basic requirements for installing and configuring MapServer"
msgstr "安装和配置MapServer的基本要求"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:19
msgid ""
"MapServer is an open source software written in C language, which itself "
"relies on some open source or free libraries, such as Shapelib, FreeType,"
" Proj.4, GDAL/OGR, GD Library, Regex. MapServer is written in C, and the "
"sub-projects it depends on have corresponding C language implementation "
"versions. When running MapServer, the relevant class libraries must be "
"installed, and sometimes they also depend on specific versions of certain"
" class libraries. When compiling and installing MapServer, you need to "
"have a certain understanding of these libraries."
msgstr "MapServer是一个用C语言编写的开源软件，它本身依赖于一些开源或免费的库，如Shapelib、FreeType、Proj.4、GDAL/OGR、GD库、Regex。MapServer是用C语言编写的，它所依赖的子项目都有相应的C语言实现版本。在运行MapServer时，必须安装相关的类库，有时它们还依赖于某些类库的特定版本。在编译和安装MapServer时，需要对这些库有一定的了解。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:28
msgid ""
"Shapelib provides the ability to read, write and update data in the “ESRI"
" Shapefile” format, and to modify the corresponding property file (.dbf);"
msgstr "Shapelib提供了读、写和更新“ESRI shapefile”格式的数据，以及修改相应的属性文件(.dbf)的能力；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:31
msgid ""
"FreeType is a font rendering library, capable of rendering most vector "
"and bitmap font formats, designed to be small, efficient, highly "
"customizable, and as lightweight as possible without sacrificing "
"performance and functionality;"
msgstr "FreeType是一个字体渲染库，能够渲染大多数矢量和位图字体格式，设计成小、高效、高度可定制和尽可能轻便，而不牺牲性能和功能；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:35
msgid ""
"Proj.4 is a geographic projection library that provides a variety of "
"projection definitions and interfaces;"
msgstr "Proj.4是一个地理投影库，提供各种投影定义和界面；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:37
msgid ""
"GDAL/OGR, GDAL (Geospatial Data Abstraction Library) is an open source "
"raster spatial data conversion library under the X/MIT license. It "
"utilizes an abstract data model to express the various file formats it "
"supports. It also has a range of command line tools for data "
"transformation and processing. OGR is a branch of the GDAL project, "
"similar in function to GDAL, except that it provides support for vector "
"data. There are many well-known GIS products that use the GDAL/OGR "
"library, including ESRI’s ArcGIS 9.3, Google Earth and the cross-platform"
" GRASS GIS system."
msgstr ""
"GDAL/OGR，GDAL(地理空间数据抽象库)是X/MIT许可下的开放源码栅格空间数据转换库。它利用抽象数据模型来表示其支持的各种文件格式。它还具有一系列用于数据转换和处理的命令行工具。OGR是GDAL项目的一个分支，在功能上类似于GDAL，只是它提供了对矢量数据的支持。有许多使用GDAL/OGR库的知名GIS产品，包括ESRI的ArcGIS"
" 9.3、Google Earth和跨平台的GRASS地理信息系统。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:46
msgid ""
"GD Library, generate images dynamically, supports most formats: JPEG, "
"GIF, WEBP, XPM, BMP. Usually used to dynamically generate charts, "
"pictures, thumbnails, etc., often used in the web environment;"
msgstr "GD库，动态生成图像，支持大多数格式：JPEG，GIF，WebP，XPM，BMP。通常用来动态生成图表、图片、缩略图等，经常在网络环境中使用；"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:49
msgid "Regex, provides regular expression support for MapServer."
msgstr "Regex为MapServer提供正则表达式支持。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:51
msgid ""
"By understanding these libraries, you can simplify the installation "
"process by reducing the number of features to install. Even though you "
"only install a basic version of MapServer, it still has the ability to "
"create a powerful application. After you become familiar with MapServer, "
"you can add other features you want."
msgstr "通过了解这些库，您可以通过减少要安装的功能数量来简化安装过程。即使您只安装了基本版本的MapServer，它仍然能够创建功能强大的应用程序。熟悉MapServer后，您可以添加所需的其他功能。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:57
msgid ""
"MapServer is a program that generates maps, but provides a CGI interface "
"(the operation of MapServer CGI depends on PHP), and related functions "
"can be called through Web access. So many times in order to run "
"MapServer, you need to install a web server (such as Apache 2), and a "
"tool (such as FastCGI) to let the application (MapServer) communicate "
"with the web server (Apache). Apache 2 does not have CGI enabled by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"MapServer是一个生成地图的程序，但提供了CGI接口(MapServer CGI的操作依赖于PHP)，相关函数可以通过Web "
"Access调用。为了多次运行MapServer，您需要安装Web服务器(如Apache2)和一个工具(如FastCGI)以使应用程序(MapServer)与Web服务器(Apache.)通信。默认情况下，Apache2没有启用CGI。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:68
msgid "Libraries that MapServer depends on"
msgstr "MapServer所依赖的库"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:73
msgid "Detailed introduction of MapServer related class libraries"
msgstr "详细介绍了MapServer相关类库"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:81
msgid "FreeType"
msgstr "FreeType"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:78
msgid ""
"FreeType is a font rendering engine. It is not referenced directly by "
"Mapserver, but is used by GD to render fonts. Since TrueType is more "
"attractive than the bitmap fonts provided by Mapserver, it is worth "
"including this class library."
msgstr "FreeType是一个字体渲染引擎。它不被MapServer直接引用，但被GD用来呈现字体。由于TrueType比Mapserver提供的位图字体更吸引人，因此值得包含这个类库。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:88
msgid "LibPNG"
msgstr "LibPNG"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:84
msgid ""
"LibPNG enables Mapserver to render JPEG images. A new version has been "
"released since 2001. Generally speaking, this library should already be "
"installed on the machine. If not, you can install it yourself. Libpng "
"uses MapServer to render PNG images. It is not directly used by "
"MapServer, but by GD. Libpng requires the library zlib."
msgstr "LibPNG使MapServer能够渲染JPEG图像。自2001年以来，一个新的版本已经发布。一般来说，这个库应该已经安装在机器上了。如果没有，您可以自己安装。Libpng使用MapServer来渲染PNG图像。它不是由MapServer直接使用，而是由GD使用。Libpng需要库zlib。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:91
msgid "Zlib"
msgstr "兹利卜"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:91
msgid "Zlib is a data compression library used by GD."
msgstr "Zlib是GD使用的数据压缩库。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:97
msgid "GDAL"
msgstr "GDAL"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:94
msgid ""
"GDAL is a conversion class library for raster data. It provides import "
"and projection of raster images with geographic projections. You won’t "
"use those features in this book, but this library is necessary to install"
" basic Mapserver."
msgstr ""
"GDAL是用于栅格数据的转换类库。它提供具有地理投影的栅格图像的导入和投影。您将不会在本书中使用这些功能，但这个库是安装Basic "
"MapServer所必需的。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:101
msgid "OGR"
msgstr "OGR"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:100
msgid ""
"The OGR library provides the ability to read and write some vector "
"formats. In this book you will use some of the features provided by OGR."
msgstr "OGR库提供了读写一些矢量格式的能力。在本书中，您将使用OGR提供的一些功能。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:105
msgid "Proj.4"
msgstr "Proj.4"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:104
msgid ""
"Proj.4 is a program for cartographic projection. It can be called by "
"Mapserver, or it can be projected on the entire database alone."
msgstr "Proj.4是一个用于地图投影的程序。它可以由MapServer调用，也可以单独投影到整个数据库上。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:113
msgid "Shapelib"
msgstr "Shapelib"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:108
msgid ""
"Shapelib is a C program to generate and process Shape files. You can use "
"the useful tools provided by this class library without having to write "
"any C code yourself. It has the contents of generating shape files "
"(including DBF files) and destroying shape files and DBF files, and "
"change the projection of the shape file. Some of these features are based"
" on Proj.4."
msgstr "Shapelib是一个C程序，用于生成和处理形状文件。您可以使用这个类库提供的有用工具，而不必自己编写任何C代码。它具有生成Shape文件(包括DBF文件)、销毁Shape文件和DBF文件以及更改Shape文件的投影的内容。其中一些功能基于Proj.4。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:120
msgid "Libcurl"
msgstr "Libcurl"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:116
msgid ""
"libcurl is a client library that supports FTP, FTPS, HTTP, HTTPS, GOPHER,"
" TELNET, DICT, FILE and LDAP URL conversion. This library is required if "
"you want to provide WMS support. The WMS protocol is used to transmit map"
" images and file data over the network. To keep the Mapserver environment"
" simple, you don’t have to install it."
msgstr "Libcurl是一个客户端库，支持FTP、FTPS、HTTP、HTTPS、Gopher、Telnet、Dict、文件和LDAPURL转换。如果要提供WMS支持，则需要此库。WMS协议用于在网络上传输地图图像和文件数据。为了保持地图服务器环境的简单，您不必安装它。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:124
msgid "SDE client library"
msgstr "SDE客户端库"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:123
msgid ""
"The SDE client library is part of ESRI’s spatial data warehouse. If you "
"want Mapserver to access it, you need to compile the library."
msgstr "SDE客户端库是ESRI空间数据仓库的一部分。如果您希望MapServer访问它，则需要编译该库。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:132
msgid "GD"
msgstr "GD"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:127
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"GD support has been removed in MapServer 7. 0. GD is an image library. GD"
" has its own dependent class library, including zlib, libpng, FreeType2.x"
" and libJPEG. These types enable GD to perform image compression (for "
"supported data), to render PNG images, to use TrueType fonts, and to "
"render JPEG images. Since the license on GIF has expired, it is now "
"available as well."
msgstr "GD是一个图像库。由于MapServer使用GD进行图像渲染，因此必须安装它。GD有自己的依赖类库，包括zlib、libpng、FreeType2.x和libJPEG。这些类型使GD能够执行图像压缩(对于支持的数据)、渲染PNG图像、使用TrueType字体以及渲染JPEG图像。由于GIF上的许可证已经过期，现在也可以使用了。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:135
msgid "PostgreSQL client library"
msgstr "PostgreSQL客户端库"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:137
msgid ""
"The PostgreSQL client library provides the ability to access PostGIS data"
" using Mapserver. They provide similar functionality to ESRI products, "
"but they are not open source."
msgstr "PostgreSQL客户端库提供了使用MapServer访问PostGIS数据的能力。它们提供与ESRI产品类似的功能，但它们不是开源的。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:142
msgid "Oracle Spatial client library"
msgstr "Oracle Spatial客户端库"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:144
msgid ""
"The Oracle Spatial client library enables users to access the Oracle "
"Spatial Data Warehouse using MapServer. They provide similar "
"functionality to ESRI products."
msgstr "Oracle Spatial客户端库使用户能够使用MapServer访问Oracle Spatial数据仓库。它们提供与ESRI产品类似的功能。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:149
msgid "Ming"
msgstr "明朝"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:151
msgid ""
"Ming enables MapServer to create SWF videos. It can provide some "
"interesting functions."
msgstr "Ming使MapServer能够创建SWF视频。它可以提供一些有趣的功能。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:155
msgid "PDFLib"
msgstr "PDFLib"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec02_setup/section.rst:157
msgid ""
"It is also useful for PDFLib to be able to output in PDF format using "
"MapServer."
msgstr "对于PDFLib来说，能够使用MapServer以PDF格式输出也很有用。"

