msgstr " Mapfile 的一些工具，包括Vim高光工具，崇高高光工具。"

#: ../../webgis-src/chb1_mapserver-setup/sec07_mapfile-basic/section.rst:294
msgid ""
"MapFile files organize various map elements into object systems with "
"hierarchical relationships. Data sources, data formats used, user "
"interaction and support for the OGC protocol are also defined in MapFile."
msgstr " Mapfile 将各种地图元素组织到具有层次关系的对象系统中。数据来源、使用的数据格式、用户交互以及对OGC协议的支持也在MapFile中定义。"

